  "Specification": "Implementation of a resource allocator using message-passing over a network. Instantiates the SchedulingAllocator module and adds request/allocate/return message handling with client-side holding and requests variables. Proves refinement of the scheduling allocator specification, mutual exclusion, liveness, and an invariant relating in-transit messages to allocator state.",
